  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.4904 provides a maturity model for smart sustainable cities. This maturity model helps to identify the goals, levels and key measures that are recommended for cities to effectively examine their current situation and determine critical capabilities needed to progress toward the long‑term goal of becoming smart sustainable cities (SSCs). The Recommendation includes:</abstract>
